<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 that pair was 34% of normal on the middle, and October to November was 52%. So far in 2026, February to March and March to April each sit at 27% of normal on the middle. Grid 25610 had its driest year in 2012 at 47%.</p>"}
